      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a Python file named `document_client.py` that provides local configuration and client helper utilities for OCR and Layout Extraction. Given the requirement to use a concrete third-party managed service, I will integrate with Amazon Textract, a service provided by AWS for document text extraction. The integration will include importing the Boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and setting up a client for Amazon Textract. </thinking>\n",
