    {
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create extract_key_values.py in the current working directory.\nTask: extracts key-value pairs from a form-like document.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bda54969001BE8nM0yKVQMxkK",
      "message_id": "msg_0bda54967001x8j9VoZsQKjB4u",
      "session_id": "ses_f425ab69fffeOurtpTfRkOdMQY",
      "time_created": 1789888121194,
      "time_updated": 1789888121194
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "type": "step-start"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bda54e97001Yg3WC7OdO57mzj",
      "message_id": "msg_0bda5496c001bsqTcGCGQ0Moz4",
      "session_id": "ses_f425ab69fffeOurtpTfRkOdMQY",
      "time_created": 1789888122519,
      "time_updated": 1789888122521
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To extract key-value pairs from a form-like document, I will use the Amazon Textract service, which is a powerful OCR (Optical Character Recognition) service that can extract text and data from various document types. I will write the Python code to use the Amazon Textract client to analyze a document and extract key-value pairs. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the `boto3` library and the use of the `textract` client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789888125644,
          "start": 1789888122521
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bda54e99001vrQjbkK5dxquj8",
      "message_id": "msg_0bda5496c001bsqTcGCGQ0Moz4",
      "session_id": "ses_f425ab69fffeOurtpTfRkOdMQY",
      "time_created": 1789888122522,
      "time_updated": 1789888125645
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "tooluse_MnJv4bmfZ3cwcbiU2d1BWT",
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "import boto3\n\ndef extract_key_values(document_path):\n    textract_client = boto3.client('textract')\n    with open(document_path, 'rb') as document:\n        image_bytes = document.read()\n    response = textract_client.analyze_document(\n        Document={'Bytes': image_bytes},\n        FeatureTypes=['FORMS'])\n    key_value_pairs = {}\n    for block in response['Blocks']:\n        if block['BlockType'] == 'KEY_VALUE_PAIR':\n            key = next((child['Text'] for child in block['Relationships'] if child['Type'] == 'CHILD' and child['Block']['BlockType'] == 'WORD'), None)\n            value = next((child['Text'] for child in block['Relationships'] if child['Type'] == 'VALUE' and child['Block']['BlockType'] == 'WORD'), None)\n            if key and value:\n                key_value_pairs[key] = value\n    return key_value_pairs",
            "filePath": "/private/var/folders/bf/pt_kfhl16yb4r9vfb588n1fm0000gn/T/vb-staged-nawnjzkj/extract_key_values.py"
          },
          "metadata": {
